Connect to any on-premises TCP or HTTP resource (Microsoft SQL Server, MySQL, or any web service) from Azure Web Sites or Azure Mobile Services, with no custom code required. To get started, just add a new Hybrid Connection to your website in the Azure Preview portal.

Learn more on <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/biztalk-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hybrid Connections</a>.

